"about.profile.message" = "---\n### User Information Statement\n\n**Why do we need user information?**\n\n- In our app, every device using our service is distinct. We aim to provide a personalized service for each user. For this, we need a way to identify each user to provide these tailored experiences.\n\n**How is the user identified?**\n\n- Our app uses the UUID (Universally Unique Identifier) generated by your device as the user identifier. It is a technical identifier ensuring the uniqueness of each user.\n\n**UUID and Personal Information**\n\n- The UUID is completely unrelated to your personal identity information. We cannot obtain any personal information from the UUID, nor do we try to. It's merely a combination of random numbers and letters used for technical purposes.\n\n**About Privacy and Security**\n\n- We value the privacy and security of our users immensely. Your UUID is used only internally in the app to provide personalized services. We never share your UUID with third parties or use it to collect personal data.\n\n**Contact Us**\n\n- If you have any doubts or questions, please feel free to contact us. Your trust and satisfaction are our greatest motivation.\n---";

